    <briefdescription>
<para>Vasicek model class </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This class implements the Vasicek model defined by <formula id="307">\[ dr_t = a(b - r_t)dt + \sigma dW_t , \]</formula> where <formula id="47">$ a $</formula>, <formula id="48">$ b $</formula> and <formula id="4">$ \sigma $</formula> are constants; a risk premium <formula id="29">$ \lambda $</formula> can also be specified. </para>    </detaileddescription>
